"""VE.Direct descriptions. Generated by tools/generate_descriptions.py.

STREAM_DESCRIPTIONS covers known Text labels across all device families.
HEX_DESCRIPTIONS maps flavor -> register name -> description. Each flavor
includes shared and inherited registers, aliases, and history/timer ranges
from for_flavor(). ANY contains the common registers. Overlaps are retained.
HEX labels expand register names;
unknown and experimental registers are marked explicitly.
This module has no runtime dependencies.
"""

